msgstr "打开配对窗口（60秒）"

msgid "Gateway Link (Multi-Gateway)"
msgstr "网关互联（多网关）"

msgid "All gateways are discovered from /etc/gw-link/peers.conf. Each gateway runs zigbeed -serve; devices across all networks can be managed and linked."
msgstr "所有网关从 /etc/gw-link/peers.conf 发现。每个网关运行 zigbeed -serve；跨网络设备可统一管理和联动。"

msgid "My IP (tell the peer gateway)"
msgstr "本机 IP（告知对端网关）"

msgid "loading..."
msgstr "加载中..."

msgid "Gateway List (editable)"
msgstr "网关列表（可编辑）"

msgid "Peer IP changes with the network environment!"
msgstr "对端 IP 会随网络环境变化！"

msgid "IP addresses are assigned by DHCP. When a gateway is moved to another router / network segment, its IP will change. Always enter the peer gateway's CURRENT IP (check it on the peer's own Status page). A wrong IP shows OFFLINE."
msgstr "IP 由 DHCP 分配。网关移到其他路由器/网段时 IP 会变。请始终填写对端网关的当前 IP（在对端状态页查看）。IP 错误会显示离线。"

msgid "Peer port"
msgstr "对端端口"

msgid "peer runs gw-link"
msgstr "对端运行 gw-link"

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid "peer runs zigbeed only"
msgstr "对端仅运行 zigbeed"

msgid "Do NOT use 1883 - that is the MQTT port, not the link port."
msgstr "不要使用 1883 - 那是 MQTT 端口，不是互联端口。"

msgid "Adding a peer restarts gw-link automatically."
msgstr "添加对端会自动重启 gw-link。"

